{"id":"7f5fd01e8505fc1f","group":"72","path":"72/72-thm-parikh-theorem-bounded.md","title":"Parikh Theorem in Bounded Arithmetic","display":"thm-parikh-theorem-bounded — Parikh Theorem in Bounded Arithmetic","type":"theorem","metadata":{"type":"theorem","book":"Handbook of Proof Theory","book_abbrev":"72","label":"72-thm-parikh-theorem-bounded","aliases":["72-thm-parikh-theorem-bounded"],"display":"thm-parikh-theorem-bounded — Parikh Theorem in Bounded Arithmetic","depends_on":["[[72-df-s2-theory]]"],"source_author":"Samuel R. Buss","source_chapter":"Samuel R. Buss, Chapter II, Proof Theory of Arithmetic, in Handbook of Proof Theory (1998)","source_sections":"§1.2.7.1; §1.3.3.2; §1.4.3–1.4.4","source_printed_pages":"87, 102, 111–112","source_pdf_pages":"99, 114, 123–124","source_pdf":"C:\\Users\\lzy\\Documents\\BaiduSyncdisk\\calibre\\libgen.li\\[Studies in Logic and the Foundatio (2867)\\[Studies in Logic and the Found - libgen.li.pdf","verification_status":"source-statement-checked","source_proof_status":"Source bounded-theory/induction-rule applicability read; full bootstrapping and free-cut bound extraction not reconstructed","eligible_as_verified_dependency":false,"round2_verification_status":"source-statement-checked; proof-scope-limited"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"theorem"},{"key":"book","html":"Handbook of Proof Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"72"},{"key":"label","html":"72-thm-parikh-theorem-bounded"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>72-thm-parikh-theorem-bounded</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"thm-parikh-theorem-bounded — Parikh Theorem in Bounded Arithmetic"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"690ac0b5f3b63c49\" href=\"?note=690ac0b5f3b63c49\" title=\"72-df-s2-theory\">72-df-s2-theory</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source_author","html":"Samuel R. Buss"},{"key":"source_chapter","html":"Samuel R. Buss, Chapter II, Proof Theory of Arithmetic, in Handbook of Proof Theory (1998)"},{"key":"source_sections","html":"§1.2.7.1; §1.3.3.2; §1.4.3–1.4.4"},{"key":"source_printed_pages","html":"87, 102, 111–112"},{"key":"source_pdf_pages","html":"99, 114, 123–124"},{"key":"source_pdf","html":"C:\\Users\\lzy\\Documents\\BaiduSyncdisk\\calibre\\libgen.li[Studies in Logic and the Foundatio (2867)[Studies in Logic and the Found - libgen.li.pdf"},{"key":"verification_status","html":"source-statement-checked"},{"key":"source_proof_status","html":"Source bounded-theory/induction-rule applicability read; full bootstrapping and free-cut bound extraction not reconstructed"},{"key":"eligible_as_verified_dependency","html":"false"},{"key":"round2_verification_status","html":"source-statement-checked; proof-scope-limited"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"i\\geq1\">\\(i\\geq1\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"S_2^i\">\\(S_2^i\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Sigma_i^b\">\\(\\Sigma_i^b\\)</span> 取 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"690ac0b5f3b63c49\" href=\"?note=690ac0b5f3b63c49\" title=\"72-df-s2-theory\">72-df-s2-theory</a>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\vdash\">\\(\\vdash\\)</span> 为固定经典一阶可证性。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\vec x=(x_0,\\ldots,x_{k-1})\">\\(\\vec x=(x_0,\\ldots,x_{k-1})\\)</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"y\">\\(y\\)</span> 为互异变量，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"k\\in\\omega\">\\(k\\in\\omega\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A(\\vec x,y)\\in\\Sigma_i^b\">\\(A(\\vec x,y)\\in\\Sigma_i^b\\)</span> 的自由变量包含于所显示变量中。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Trm}_S(\\mathcal L_{\\mathrm{BA}})\">\\(\\mathrm{Trm}_S(\\mathcal L_{\\mathrm{BA}})\\)</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{VarTerm}_{\\mathrm{BA}}\">\\(\\operatorname{VarTerm}_{\\mathrm{BA}}\\)</span> 为该语言项及变量支持接口。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\bigl(S_2^i\\vdash\\forall\\vec x\\;\\exists y\\;A(\\vec x,y)\\bigr)\n\\ \\Longrightarrow\\\n\\exists t\\in\\mathrm{Trm}_S(\\mathcal L_{\\mathrm{BA}})\\;\n\\bigl[\\operatorname{VarTerm}_{\\mathrm{BA}}(t)\\subseteq\\{x_0,\\ldots,x_{k-1}\\}\\land\nS_2^i\\vdash\\forall\\vec x\\;\\exists y\\leq t(\\vec x)\\;A(\\vec x,y)\\bigr].\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\bigl(S_2^i\\vdash\\forall\\vec x\\;\\exists y\\;A(\\vec x,y)\\bigr)\n\\ \\Longrightarrow\\\n\\exists t\\in\\mathrm{Trm}_S(\\mathcal L_{\\mathrm{BA}})\\;\n\\bigl[\\operatorname{VarTerm}_{\\mathrm{BA}}(t)\\subseteq\\{x_0,\\ldots,x_{k-1}\\}\\land\nS_2^i\\vdash\\forall\\vec x\\;\\exists y\\leq t(\\vec x)\\;A(\\vec x,y)\\bigr].\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>Ch. II 印刷 pp. 87、102、111–112（PDF pp. 99、114、123–124）。§1.3.3.2 明确对 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Sigma_i^b\">\\(\\Sigma_i^b\\)</span> 可定义函数应用 Parikh 界；一般存在关系形式由 §1.4.3 的有界理论版本给出。</li>\n<li>原 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"i=1\">\\(i=1\\)</span> 陈述是本式的特例；扩充至 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"i\\geq1\">\\(i\\geq1\\)</span> 采用同一源定理。§1.4.3 明确允许有界公式的归纳规则；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"S_2^i\">\\(S_2^i\\)</span> 按 §1.4.1 使用 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Sigma_i^b\">\\(\\Sigma_i^b\\)</span>-PIND 规则。所需项界闭包与序的性质由该理论的 bootstrapping 提供。</li>\n<li>只核对陈述、归纳规则适用范围及来源证明提纲，未完成所有 free-cut 推理的核验。此结果不允许把任意增添非有界总函数公理的扩张也代入。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"72-df-s2-theory","status":"resolved","id":"690ac0b5f3b63c49","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[72-df-s2-theory]]","embed":false},{"target":"72-df-s2-theory","status":"resolved","id":"690ac0b5f3b63c49","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$i\\geq1$；$S_2^i$、$\\Sigma_i^b$ 取 [[72-df-s2-theory]]；$\\vdash$ 为固定经典一阶可证性。","embed":false}],"attachments":[],"math":[{"tex":"i\\geq1","display":false},{"tex":"S_2^i","display":false},{"tex":"\\Sigma_i^b","display":false},{"tex":"\\vdash","display":false},{"tex":"\\vec x=(x_0,\\ldots,x_{k-1})","display":false},{"tex":"y","display":false},{"tex":"k\\in\\omega","display":false},{"tex":"A(\\vec x,y)\\in\\Sigma_i^b","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Trm}_S(\\mathcal L_{\\mathrm{BA}})","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{VarTerm}_{\\mathrm{BA}}","display":false},{"tex":"\\bigl(S_2^i\\vdash\\forall\\vec x\\;\\exists y\\;A(\\vec x,y)\\bigr)\n\\ \\Longrightarrow\\\n\\exists t\\in\\mathrm{Trm}_S(\\mathcal L_{\\mathrm{BA}})\\;\n\\bigl[\\operatorname{VarTerm}_{\\mathrm{BA}}(t)\\subseteq\\{x_0,\\ldots,x_{k-1}\\}\\land\nS_2^i\\vdash\\forall\\vec x\\;\\exists y\\leq t(\\vec x)\\;A(\\vec x,y)\\bigr].","display":true},{"tex":"\\Sigma_i^b","display":false},{"tex":"i=1","display":false},{"tex":"i\\geq1","display":false},{"tex":"S_2^i","display":false},{"tex":"\\Sigma_i^b","display":false}],"bytes":2484,"backlinks":[{"id":"4d85a6a31705a214","anchor":"ref-225","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[./72-thm-parikh-theorem-bounded|thm-parikh-theorem-bounded — Parikh Theorem in Bounded Arithmetic]]"},{"id":"58e12abc814f8c50","anchor":"ref-2","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""}],"outgoing":["690ac0b5f3b63c49"]}